<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="A simpler way to manage your school. Bring attendance, academics, communication, and school operations together in one place.">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f8f5">
    <title>Classroom — School, working together</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/home.css">
    <script src="/home.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="site-header">
        <div class="container header-inner">
            <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Classroom home">
                <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none"><path d="M4 13.5 16 5l12 8.5v13H4v-13Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M12 26.5v-8h8v8M9 14h.01M16 14h.01M23 14h.01" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                </span>
                <span>classroom<span class="brand-period">.</span></span>
            </a>
            <button class="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Open navigation" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="main-nav">
                <span></span><span></span>
            </button>
            <nav class="main-nav" id="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
                <a href="#platform">Platform</a>
                <a href="#for-everyone">Who it's for</a>
                <a href="#stories">Stories</a>
                <a href="#faq">FAQs</a>
                <div class="nav-actions">
                    <button class="button button-quiet" type="button" data-open-auth="login">Log in</button>
                    <button class="button button-dark button-small" type="button" data-open-auth="signup">Get started <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
                </div>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
        <section class="hero container">
            <div class="hero-copy">
                <div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> A little more room to learn</div>
                <h1>School days,<br> <span>in sync.</span></h1>
                <p class="hero-description">One thoughtful place for the people, plans, and little moments that make a school day work.</p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <button class="button button-dark" type="button" data-open-auth="signup">Bring your school together <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
                    <a class="text-link" href="#platform">Take a look around <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
                </div>
                <div class="hero-proof">
                    <div class="avatar-stack" aria-hidden="true"><span>J</span><span>M</span><span>A</span><span>K</span></div>
                    <p><strong>Made for the whole school</strong><br>From the front office to the last row.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-art" aria-label="A preview of a school dashboard">
                <div class="art-sun"></div>
                <div class="dashboard-card">
                    <div class="dashboard-topline"><span class="window-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>MONDAY, OCTOBER 12</span></div>
                    <div class="dashboard-title"><div><span class="small-label">YOUR SCHOOL, TODAY</span><h2>Good morning,<br>Ms. Morgan <span aria-hidden="true">☀</span></h2></div><span class="profile-avatar">M</span></div>
                    <div class="dash-summary">
                        <div><span class="summary-icon green-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="summary-label">Attendance</span><strong>94.8%</strong><small>Looking good today</small></div>
                        <div><span class="summary-icon yellow-icon" aria-hidden="true">◷</span><span class="summary-label">Next up</span><strong>Assembly</strong><small>Gym · 10:30 am</small></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="schedule-heading"><strong>On the calendar</strong><a href="#platform">See all</a></div>
                    <div class="schedule-row"><span class="schedule-time">09:15</span><span class="schedule-line line-purple"></span><span><strong>Year 5 · Science</strong><small>Room 204 · Mr. Lee</small></span><span class="schedule-tag">Now</span></div>
                    <div class="schedule-row"><span class="schedule-time">10:30</span><span class="schedule-line line-orange"></span><span><strong>School assembly</strong><small>Main gym · All school</small></span></div>
                    <div class="schedule-row"><span class="schedule-time">11:45</span><span class="schedule-line line-blue"></span><span><strong>Family conferences</strong><small>Library · 4 appointments</small></span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="floating-note"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span><div><strong>It's a team effort</strong><small>Everyone in the loop.</small></div></div>
                <div class="art-caption">A clearer view of the school day <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="trust-strip" aria-label="Built for school communities">
            <div class="container trust-inner"><span>LESS BUSYWORK.<br>MORE SCHOOLWORK.</span><i></i><p>One home for <strong>the everyday essentials</strong></p><span class="trust-note">Thoughtfully connected<br>for every school community.</span></div>
        </section>

        <section class="section container" id="platform">
            <div class="section-heading">
                <div><div class="eyebrow">Everything in its place</div><h2>The whole school day,<br><span>working together.</span></h2></div>
                <p>Less chasing updates across different tools. More time for the things only your school can do.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-grid">
                <article class="feature-card feature-green"><span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">◷</span><span class="card-kicker">THE DAILY RHYTHM</span><h3>Attendance, without the paper trail.</h3><p>Take the register, spot patterns, and keep a clear record of who's here.</p><a href="#for-everyone" class="card-link">Attendance &amp; records <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="mini-register"><div><span>Today’s attendance</span><strong>94.8%</strong></div><span class="mini-bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>↑ 2.4% from last Monday</small></div></article>
                <article class="feature-card feature-lilac"><span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><span class="card-kicker">THE LEARNING</span><h3>A little more clarity on progress.</h3><p>Bring class schedules, coursework, and progress updates together.</p><a href="#for-everyone" class="card-link">Classes &amp; academics <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="mini-subjects"><span><i class="subject-dot dot-orange"></i>Science <b>On track</b></span><span><i class="subject-dot dot-blue"></i>Maths <b>2 updates</b></span><span><i class="subject-dot dot-green"></i>Reading <b>On track</b></span></div></article>
                <article class="feature-card feature-yellow"><span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">♡</span><span class="card-kicker">THE CONVERSATIONS</span><h3>Families in the loop, naturally.</h3><p>Share notices, celebrate milestones, and make it easier to stay connected.</p><a href="#for-everyone" class="card-link">Family communication <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="mini-message"><span class="message-avatar">S</span><span><strong>Ms. Santos</strong><small>Field trip forms are due Friday!</small></span><span class="message-check">✓</span></div></article>
                <article class="feature-card feature-blue"><span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">▦</span><span class="card-kicker">THE SCHOOL OPERATIONS</span><h3>The little details, handled.</h3><p>Keep the timetable, staff updates, and school resources in one shared view.</p><a href="#for-everyone" class="card-link">Schedules &amp; operations <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="mini-calendar"><span><b>MON</b>12</span><span><b>TUE</b>13</span><span class="calendar-active"><b>WED</b>14</span><span><b>THU</b>15</span><span><b>FRI</b>16</span></div></article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="audience-section" id="for-everyone">
            <div class="container audience-inner">
                <div class="audience-copy"><div class="eyebrow">A place for every perspective</div><h2>One school.<br><span>Many ways in.</span></h2><p>Everyone has a different part to play. Give each person a clearer view of what matters to them.</p><button class="button button-dark" type="button" data-open-auth="signup">Find your school's fit <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>
                <div class="role-list">
                    <article class="role-card"><span class="role-number">01</span><span class="role-icon role-admin" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span><div><h3>School leaders &amp; admins</h3><p>A calmer overview of daily operations, records, and what's coming up.</p></div><span class="role-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article>
                    <article class="role-card"><span class="role-number">02</span><span class="role-icon role-teacher" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><div><h3>Teachers &amp; staff</h3><p>Keep class routines, attendance, and important updates close at hand.</p></div><span class="role-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article>
                    <article class="role-card"><span class="role-number">03</span><span class="role-icon role-family" aria-hidden="true">♡</span><div><h3>Families &amp; caregivers</h3><p>Stay connected to school notices, schedules, and student progress.</p></div><span class="role-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article>
                    <article class="role-card"><span class="role-number">04</span><span class="role-icon role-student" aria-hidden="true">✎</span><div><h3>Students</h3><p>See what's next, keep track of classwork, and own the school day.</p></div><span class="role-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="quote-section container" id="stories">
            <div class="quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</div>
            <blockquote>When everyone knows what’s happening, there’s more space for what matters: <span>helping students grow.</span></blockquote>
            <div class="quote-attribution"><span class="quote-avatar">R</span><span><strong>A better day starts together.</strong><small>Made for school communities, everywhere.</small></span></div>
            <div class="quote-decoration" aria-hidden="true">✳</div>
        </section>

        <section class="faq-section container" id="faq">
            <div class="faq-intro"><div class="eyebrow">A few good questions</div><h2>Good to<br><span>know.</span></h2><p>Curious about how it all fits together? Start here.</p><button type="button" class="text-link faq-login" data-open-auth="login">Already have an account? Log in <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>
            <div class="faq-list">
                <details><summary>What is Classroom? <span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>Classroom is a school management experience that brings everyday school information—like attendance, schedules, learning updates, and family communication—into one place.</p></details>
                <details><summary>Who can use the platform? <span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>It’s designed for the whole school community: administrators, teachers and staff, students, and families. Your school can shape access around the needs of each role.</p></details>
                <details><summary>How do I get an account? <span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>Use “Get started” to create an account, or check with your school administrator about joining your school’s community.</p></details>
                <details><summary>Can families keep up with school updates? <span aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><p>Yes. The platform is designed to make school notices, schedules, and student updates easier for families and caregivers to follow.</p></details>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="closing-section container">
            <div><span class="closing-spark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><p>A school day is a lot of moving parts.</p><h2>Let’s make them<br><span>move together.</span></h2></div>
            <button class="button button-light" type="button" data-open-auth="signup">Get your school started <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
            <div class="closing-shape closing-shape-one" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="closing-shape closing-shape-two" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer container">
        <a class="brand footer-brand" href="/" aria-label="Classroom home"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none"><path d="M4 13.5 16 5l12 8.5v13H4v-13Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M12 26.5v-8h8v8M9 14h.01M16 14h.01M23 14h.01" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span>classroom<span class="brand-period">.</span></span></a>
        <p>Good school days, made together.</p>
        <div class="footer-links"><a href="#platform">Platform</a><a href="#for-everyone">Who it's for</a><a href="#faq">FAQs</a><button type="button" data-open-auth="login">Log in</button><a href="/super-admin">Super admin</a></div>
        <small>© <span id="current-year">2025</span> Classroom. Made for the school day.</small>
    </footer>

    <dialog class="auth-dialog" aria-labelledby="auth-title">
        <button class="dialog-close" type="button" aria-label="Close dialog">×</button>
        <div class="dialog-brand"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none"><path d="M4 13.5 16 5l12 8.5v13H4v-13Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M12 26.5v-8h8v8M9 14h.01M16 14h.01M23 14h.01" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></div>
        <div class="auth-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Account options">
            <button type="button" role="tab" id="signup-tab" aria-controls="signup-panel" aria-selected="true" data-auth-tab="signup">Create account</button>
            <button type="button" role="tab" id="login-tab" aria-controls="login-panel" aria-selected="false" data-auth-tab="login">Log in</button>
        </div>
        <section id="signup-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="signup-tab">
            <h2 id="auth-title">A good place to start.</h2>
            <p class="dialog-description">Create your Classroom account to get the conversation started.</p>
            <form class="auth-form" id="signup-form">
                <label for="signup-std-id">Student ID</label><input id="signup-std-id" name="std_id" type="text" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Your student ID" required>
                <label for="signup-name">Your name</label><input id="signup-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" placeholder="e.g. Jordan Lee" required>
                <label for="signup-department">Department</label><input id="signup-department" name="department" type="text" autocomplete="organization-title" placeholder="e.g. Computer Science" required>
                <label for="signup-email">Email address</label><input id="signup-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@school.edu" required>
                <label for="signup-password">Password</label><input id="signup-password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="8" placeholder="At least 8 characters" required>
                <button class="button button-dark auth-submit" type="submit">Create account <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
                <p class="form-message" id="signup-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
            </form>
            <p class="auth-switch">Already have an account? <button type="button" data-auth-tab="login">Log in</button></p>
        </section>
        <section id="login-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="login-tab" hidden>
            <h2>Welcome back.</h2>
            <p class="dialog-description">Log in to pick up where your school day left off.</p>
            <form class="auth-form" id="login-form">
                <label for="login-email">Email address</label><input id="login-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@school.edu" required>
                <label for="login-password">Password</label><input id="login-password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="Your password" required>
                <button class="button button-dark auth-submit" type="submit">Log in <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
                <p class="form-message" id="login-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
            </form>
            <p class="auth-switch">New to Classroom? <button type="button" data-auth-tab="signup">Create an account</button></p>
        </section>
    </dialog>
</body>
</html>